  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 24-layer planar dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand) (24 layers total, starting with HfO2 at air interface). Optimize individual thickness of each layer to maximize transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Run 5 optimization rounds using gradient_thickness optimizer. Initial thickness bounds: 30-150 nm per layer. During optimization, log per-layer standard deviation across candidates. If best_target_score improves by less than 1e-4 per round for two consecutive rounds while layer-wise thickness variance exceeds 5 nm, reduce optimizer step size by 15% and continue with locally constrained coordinate descent. Materials: hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) from material_catalog. Wavelength bands: 400-700 nm (reflectance target), 1530-1565 nm (transmittance target). Incidence: air side, normal incidence assumed. Substrate: fused silica.",
